# Title: User Discovery And Export Via Get-ADUser Cmdlet
# ID: 1114e048-b69c-4f41-bc20-657245ae6e3f
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-09-09
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1033
# Description: Detects usage of the Get-ADUser cmdlet to collect user information and output it to a file
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((CommandLine CONTAIN "Get-ADUser " AND CommandLine CONTAIN " -Filter \\*") AND (CommandLine CONTAIN " > " OR CommandLine CONTAIN " | Select " OR CommandLine CONTAIN "Out-File" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "Set-Content" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "Add-Content")) AND (((Image="*\\powershell.exe" OR Image="*\\pwsh.exe")) OR ((OriginalFileName = "PowerShell.EXE" OR OriginalFileName = "pwsh.dll"))))
